# 2. CORE PRODUCT CONCEPT

The platform has four important concepts:

## A. Organization / Tenant

Every customer is an organization.

Examples:

```text
ABC International School
Apollo Medical Store
XYZ Corporate Office
```

Each organization has completely isolated:

* Users
* Inventory
* Suppliers
* Categories
* Transactions
* Modules
* Settings
* Receipt templates
* Custom fields
* Reports

The UI should always make the current organization clear.

Example:

```text
