Book Management
Student Issue / Return
Asset Management
Procurement
Barcode / QR
Pharmacy Management
Batch & Expiry Tracking
Employee Asset Allocation
Maintenance
```

Do NOT make these modules separate applications.

They are modules inside the same SaaS platform.

