Do NOT:

* Build separate applications for school and pharmacy.
* Hardcode school navigation throughout the application.
* Hardcode pharmacy navigation throughout the application.
* Create duplicate inventory components.
* Put all data directly inside JSX.
* Build a fake payment system.
* Build unnecessary authentication complexity.
* Build a real plugin marketplace.
* Build a complicated backend inside Bolt.
