* Build reusable tables.
* Build reusable forms.
* Build reusable item detail views.
* Use configuration to control modules.
* Use organization context.
* Use TypeScript types.
* Keep mock data separate.
* Keep API services separate.
* Make the architecture ready for FastAPI.
* Make the UI feel like a real SaaS product.

