# 34. MOST IMPORTANT PRODUCT PRINCIPLE

The architecture should communicate:

```text
                    INVENTORY PLATFORM
                           │
              ┌────────────┴────────────┐
              │                         │
          CORE ENGINE             MODULE SYSTEM
              │                         │
        ┌─────┼─────┐          ┌────────┼─────────┐
        │     │     │          │        │         │
      Items Stock Users      Uniforms  Books   Pharmacy
        │
        └──────────────┐
                       │
                 ORGANIZATION
                  CONFIGURATION
                       │
             ┌─────────┼─────────┐
             │         │         │
        Custom Fields Workflows Templates
```

The **core inventory engine must remain generic**.

Modules provide specialized functionality.

Organization configuration determines how those modules behave.

Subscription determines which capabilities the organization is entitled to use.

